#: ../../01-quick-start.md:1 2552d0e09afa4926bf7552732c5ea666
msgid "01. Quick Start"
msgstr "01. 快速入门"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:5 e1e2b6ac8b934013bfb72e7f74b6bf0e
msgid ""
"Goal: get a `freeswitch` process running from **this clone** and prove it "
"with `fs_cli -x status`. Vanilla XML is a demo PBX, not a production "
"baseline (`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`). Operator-facing first-call "
"steps (register 1000/1001, dial `9196`) match [Users Manual Chapter "
"2](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/getting-started)."
msgstr ""
"目标：从 **本克隆** 跑起 `freeswitch` 进程，并用 `fs_cli -x status` 验证。Vanilla XML 是演示 "
"PBX，不是生产基线（`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`）。面向运维的首呼步骤（注册 1000/1001、拨 "
"`9196`）与 [用户手册第 2 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/getting-started) "
"一致。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:7 59bbc993784e446390f609477503dcb0
msgid ""
"If you only need a packaged daemon on Debian and have a SignalWire token, "
"skip to [Install from packages](#install-from-packages-debian). That is what"
" `README.md` recommends for operators."
msgstr ""
"如果只需要在 Debian 上安装打包好的守护进程且已有 SignalWire token，可跳到 [从软件包安装](#install-from-"
"packages-debian)。这是 `README.md` 向运维人员推荐的路径。"

