#: ../../01-quick-start.md 52f55b7b138142f49711e36d69e3ce25
msgid ""
"**Not fully in this repo.** CI clones [sofia-"
"sip](https://github.com/freeswitch/sofia-sip); the Debian 11 source "
"Dockerfile also builds libks, spandsp, and signalwire-c "
"(`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile`)."
msgstr ""
"**并不完全在本仓库内。** CI 会克隆 [sofia-sip](https://github.com/freeswitch/sofia-"
"sip)；Debian 11 源码 Dockerfile 还会构建 libks、spandsp 和 "
"signalwire-c（`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile`）。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:21 b521387a5a7a46a680b5569be10c82e6
msgid ""
"Debian/Ubuntu source-build packages used in "
"`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile` include `build-essential`, `cmake`, "
"`automake`, `autoconf`, `libtool-bin`, `pkg-config`, `libssl-dev`, "
"`zlib1g-dev`, `libpcre2-dev`, `libedit-dev`, `libsqlite3-dev`, "
"`libcurl4-openssl-dev`, `libspeexdsp-dev`, `libopus-dev`, `libsndfile1-dev`,"
" `liblua5.2-dev`, `python3-dev`, `libpq-dev`, and related codec/AV headers."
msgstr ""
"`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile` 中用于 Debian/Ubuntu 源码构建的软件包包括 `build-"
"essential`、`cmake`、`automake`、`autoconf`、`libtool-bin`、`pkg-config`、`libssl-"
"dev`、`zlib1g-dev`、`libpcre2-dev`、`libedit-"
"dev`、`libsqlite3-dev`、`libcurl4-openssl-dev`、`libspeexdsp-dev`、`libopus-"
"dev`、`libsndfile1-dev`、`liblua5.2-dev`、`python3-dev`、`libpq-dev` 以及相关编解码器/AV"
" 头文件。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:23 f43f4cc2528e486da9ebb81add2d5605
