"`speexdsp`, …) plus `signalwire/homebrew-"
"signalwire/{libks2,signalwire-c2,spandsp}`."
msgstr ""
"macOS CI（`.github/workflows/macos.yml`）安装 Homebrew "
"formula（`autoconf`、`automake`、`libtool`、`pcre2`、`sofia-"
"sip`、`opus`、`speexdsp` 等）以及 `signalwire/homebrew-"
"signalwire/{libks2,signalwire-c2,spandsp}`。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:25 994476a51d40497ab59bf5b8bf6cd281
msgid "Clone and Install"
msgstr "克隆与安装"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:27 4136cd08af2546839b8bec979999655a
msgid ""
"You already have the tree if you are reading this PKB. From a fresh machine:"
msgstr "如果你正在阅读本 PKB，说明已经有这份代码树。在全新机器上："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:34 7be408641ec54715925a16feb8685d1c
msgid ""
"This workspace is version **1.11.3-dev** (`configure.ac`). Upstream default "
"remote is `https://github.com/signalwire/freeswitch`."
msgstr ""
"本工作区版本为 **1.11.3-dev**（`configure.ac`）。上游默认 remote 为 "
"`https://github.com/signalwire/freeswitch`。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:36 aca42479ea0c451fbddd5c3c2557d508
msgid "Source build (developer path)"
msgstr "源码构建（开发者路径）"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:38 b71b04401c1144b499c988ae38c74ec5
msgid ""
"Install Sofia-SIP (and libks / SpanDSP / signalwire-c) first, the same way "
"CI and `docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile` do. Then, from the repo root:"
msgstr ""
"先按 CI 和 `docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile` 的方式安装 Sofia-SIP（以及 libks / "
"SpanDSP / signalwire-c）。然后在仓库根目录执行："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:47 383f4bbe0424494099b0da7862c04b3b
msgid ""
"`bootstrap.sh` copies `build/modules.conf.in` → `modules.conf` if missing, "
"then runs Autotools. `-j` parallelizes library bootstraps."
msgstr ""
"若缺少 `modules.conf`，`bootstrap.sh` 会把 `build/modules.conf.in` 复制为 "
"`modules.conf`，然后运行 Autotools。`-j` 用于并行引导依赖库。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:48 a31c01efff9840038bcf08cf65b7fc0b
msgid ""
"Default prefix without `--prefix` is `/usr/local/freeswitch` "
"(`configure.ac`). The explicit `--disable-fhs` keeps this developer install "
"under `$HOME/fs`; a custom prefix without that flag uses FHS paths such as "
"`$HOME/fs/etc/freeswitch` and `$HOME/fs/var/log/freeswitch`."
msgstr ""
"不带 `--prefix` 时默认前缀为 `/usr/local/freeswitch`（`configure.ac`）。显式指定 "
"`--disable-fhs` 会使本开发者安装位于 `$HOME/fs` 下；未指定该选项的自定义前缀会使用 FHS 路径，例如 "
"`$HOME/fs/etc/freeswitch` 和 `$HOME/fs/var/log/freeswitch`。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:49 57d2a3227605411d89cc2a4fd8945080
msgid ""
"`make install` also installs vanilla sample config when `$(confdir)` does "
"not exist (`Makefile.am`: `test -d $(DESTDIR)$(confdir) || $(MAKE) samples-"
"conf`)."
msgstr ""
"当 `$(confdir)` 不存在时，`make install` 还会安装 vanilla 示例配置（`Makefile.am`：`test -d "
"$(DESTDIR)$(confdir) || $(MAKE) samples-conf`）。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:50 5d978dc4bef3406ab74ceac1a2637f1f
msgid ""
"Prompts and music-on-hold are **not** in this git tree. After `make "
"install`, [Chapter "
"2](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/getting-started) "
"also runs `make cd-sounds-install cd-moh-install` (Callie 8 kHz packages; "
"`Makefile.am` `sounds-install`). Skip only if you do not need playback/echo "
"tests."
msgstr ""
"提示音与保持音乐**不在**本 git 树中。`make install` 之后，[第 2 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/getting-started) "
"还会跑 `make cd-sounds-install cd-moh-install`（Callie 8 kHz 包；`Makefile.am` 的 "
"`sounds-install`）。只有不需要放音/回声测试时才可跳过。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:51 243fa26da0d944ac9e4a636859a73e8f
msgid ""
"Debug symbols without changing configure flags: `./devel-bootstrap.sh` sets "
"`CFLAGS`/`CXXFLAGS` to `-ggdb3 -O0` then bootstraps and configures."
msgstr ""
"无需改 configure 参数即可带调试符号：`./devel-bootstrap.sh` 将 `CFLAGS`/`CXXFLAGS` 设为 "
"`-ggdb3 -O0`，然后执行 bootstrap 和 configure。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:53 9c5c45f784ca44bb8fdd2f4a32885d16
msgid ""
"Enable extra modules by uncommenting lines in `modules.conf` **after** "
"bootstrap and **before** `./configure` / `make`. CI’s unit-test configure "
"(`ci.sh`) is an example of that edit pattern."
msgstr ""
"在 bootstrap **之后**、`./configure` / `make` **之前**，通过取消 `modules.conf` "
"中对应行的注释来启用额外模块。CI 的单元测试 configure（`ci.sh`）就是这种修改方式的例子。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:55 d698712d5b7b471ea03fdf262c788632
msgid "Install from packages (Debian)"
msgstr "从软件包安装（Debian）"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:57 6838d80d224146408b80d2d410f85df4
msgid ""
"Requires a SignalWire Personal Access Token. From "
"`scripts/packaging/README.md`:"
msgstr "需要 SignalWire Personal Access Token。摘自 `scripts/packaging/README.md`："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:65 017ad2b383764c399df58306f8a48638
msgid ""
"`release` tracks packaged releases; `prerelease` tracks what you see on "
"`master`."
msgstr "`release` 跟踪已打包发行版；`prerelease` 跟踪你在 `master` 上看到的内容。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:67 596eba53ffa44b779172f7d3b005cda4
msgid ""
"Meta packages (Users Manual Ch 2): `freeswitch-meta-all` (every module), "
"`freeswitch-meta-vanilla` (vanilla set + typically `freeswitch-sounds-en-us-"
"callie` / `freeswitch-sounds-music`), `freeswitch-meta-default`, "
"`freeswitch-meta-bare`. Packaged config root is `/etc/freeswitch`; systemd: "
"`systemctl enable --now freeswitch`."
msgstr ""
"元软件包（用户手册第 2 章）：`freeswitch-meta-all`（全部模块）、`freeswitch-meta-"
"vanilla`（vanilla 集合，通常还带 `freeswitch-sounds-en-us-callie` / `freeswitch-"
"sounds-music`）、`freeswitch-meta-default`、`freeswitch-meta-bare`。打包安装的配置根是 "
"`/etc/freeswitch`；systemd：`systemctl enable --now freeswitch`。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:69 9abe527122f842c891305cb35db7defd
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:71 d262129b390b4f92b5475bb294fe612e
msgid ""
"Packaged image (`docker/master/Dockerfile`) also needs a SignalWire `TOKEN` "
"build-arg. The Debian 11 example is a **source image**, but its Dockerfile "
"clones FreeSWITCH and its dependencies during the image build; it does not "
"compile the checkout you are reading. From the repository root, build and "
"run that example with:"
msgstr ""
"软件包镜像（`docker/master/Dockerfile`）还需要 SignalWire `TOKEN` 构建参数。Debian 11 "
"示例是**源码镜像**，但其 Dockerfile 会在构建镜像时克隆 FreeSWITCH 及其依赖；它不会编译你正在阅读的这个 "
"checkout。在仓库根目录运行以下命令构建并运行该示例："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:77 3493bd5bde3b482bbc7f3adff50850e2
msgid ""
"For a source image built from this exact checkout, use the native source-"
"build path above or create a separate Dockerfile that copies this tree into "
"the build context."
msgstr ""
"如果要从当前 checkout 构建源码镜像，请使用上面的原生源码构建路径，或创建一个将此树复制到构建上下文中的独立 Dockerfile。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:79 482cdcb86c5e4767b61687fd3862c1fc
msgid ""
"Runtime containers expect **host networking** (`docker/README.md`). Typical "
"ports: SIP 5060/5080, TLS 5061/5081, Sofia SIP WebSocket 5066/7443, Verto "
"WS/WSS 8081/8082, ESL **8021**, RTP UDP ranges 16384–32768 and 64535–65535."
msgstr ""
"运行时容器需要 **host 网络**（`docker/README.md`）。常见端口：SIP 5060/5080、TLS "
"5061/5081、Sofia SIP WebSocket 5066/7443、Verto WS/WSS 8081/8082、ESL "
"**8021**、RTP UDP 范围 16384–32768 和 64535–65535。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:83 ee81aa2a471547c3b8e20799e31332eb
msgid "Run and smoke-test `freeswitch:local` on Ubuntu"
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 上运行并进行 `freeswitch:local` 冒烟测试"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:85 ba9446f739bd48c1ada23db3cb3afc86
msgid ""
"The Compose wrapper builds the Debian 11 example as `freeswitch:local` and "
"starts one detached container:"
msgstr "Compose 包装脚本将 Debian 11 示例构建为 `freeswitch:local`，并启动一个后台容器："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:96 5310d39b80624fa7a178e3eca8c4e4cf
msgid ""
"Host networking is a Linux feature and avoids publishing the large RTP "
"ranges individually. Do not add `-p` options when using `--network host`."
msgstr ""
"Host 网络是 Linux 特性，可避免逐一发布较大的 RTP 端口范围。使用 `--network host` 时不要添加 `-p` 选项。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:98 9bd462a41bec47d3ae0f97095d6bc245
msgid "Check the container, FreeSWITCH core, and SIP profiles:"
msgstr "检查容器、FreeSWITCH 核心和 SIP 配置档："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:106 1ad5027068c94718b8dbe2500f96a5b7
msgid ""
"A healthy smoke test shows the container as `Up`, an `UP` line from "
"`status`, and `internal` / `external` profiles from `sofia status`. If a "
"check fails, inspect the latest logs:"
msgstr ""
"健康的冒烟测试应显示容器为 `Up`、`status` 输出中有一行 `UP`，并且 `sofia status` 显示 `internal` / "
"`external` 配置档。如果检查失败，请查看最新日志："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:112 99758756c7e047aeb66a707ebd29031b
msgid ""
"For a call-path test, configure a SIP softphone on a machine that can reach "
"the Ubuntu host:"
msgstr "要测试呼叫路径，请在能够访问 Ubuntu 主机的设备上配置 SIP 软电话："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:122 7c9ad01a49974bc397f259b9124484bc
msgid ""
"Confirm the registration, then dial **`9196`** and verify that speech is "
"echoed back:"
msgstr "确认注册成功，然后拨打 **`9196`**，验证语音会被回声返回："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:129 812e9fecb1e948638c908756627d87c7
msgid "UDP 5060 and RTP 16384–32768 must be reachable from the softphone."
msgstr "软电话必须能够访问 UDP 5060 以及 RTP 16384–32768。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:131 152464e16e5d452e840db7b7f8c04b40
msgid "Install and test Music on Hold (MoH)"
msgstr "安装并测试保持音乐（MoH）"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:133 337eab1be07e485a8d882461973eaef2
msgid ""
"The source image may not include `curl`, which `build/getsounds.sh` needs to"
" download the MoH archive. Install it in the running container, then "
"explicitly set the download command:"
msgstr ""
"源码镜像可能不包含 `curl`，而 `build/getsounds.sh` 需要它下载 MoH 归档。请在运行中的容器内安装 "
"`curl`，然后显式设置下载命令："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:145 44e77cde69b94ff284b3772398143f3f
msgid ""
"Restart the existing container and call **`9664`** from the softphone. You "
"should hear Music on Hold:"
msgstr "重启现有容器，然后从软电话拨打 **`9664`**。你应能听到保持音乐："

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:152 ed90865507df4cf6a06fc95826766f0e
msgid ""
"The sound files survive `docker restart` but are lost when the container is "
"removed and recreated. For a persistent image, add `curl` and `make cd-moh-"
"install` to the Dockerfile build instead of installing them only in a "
"running container."
msgstr ""
"声音文件会在 `docker restart` 后保留，但删除并重新创建容器后会丢失。要制作持久镜像，请将 `curl` 和 `make cd-moh-"
"install` 加入 Dockerfile 构建过程，而不是只在运行中的容器内安装。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:154 5f7ed3e6c2da4d11b32b0251043cc1b5
msgid "Open UFW for SIP clients from any address"
msgstr "为来自任意地址的 SIP 客户端开放 UFW"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:156 4420faa2d0da4391938591b05c18a5a8
msgid ""
