#: ../../01-quick-start.md:177 eb1b9542a6844eb499b8522363761409
msgid ""
"With `--network host`, these host firewall rules apply directly and Docker "
"`-p` options remain unnecessary. A cloud VM also needs equivalent inbound "
"security-group rules for UDP 5060 and UDP 16384–32768; opening UFW alone "
"cannot bypass the provider firewall."
msgstr ""
"使用 `--network host` 时，这些主机防火墙规则会直接生效，因此不需要 Docker `-p` 选项。云虚拟机还需要为 UDP 5060 "
"和 UDP 16384–32768 配置等效的入站安全组规则；仅开放 UFW 无法绕过云服务商防火墙。"

#: ../../01-quick-start.md:179 f2b7d90155124dfbb58fd60367c3f4bf
msgid ""
"Opening these rules to any address exposes SIP to internet scanning and "
"toll-fraud attempts. The vanilla users and password above are deliberately "
"insecure demo values; replace all SIP passwords and apply "
"authentication/rate-limiting controls first. Keep ESL port **8021** "
"restricted to localhost or a trusted management network; Linphone does not "
"need it. Stop and remove the test container with `docker stop freeswitch && "
"docker rm freeswitch`."
msgstr ""
"向任意地址开放这些规则会使 SIP 暴露于互联网扫描和话费欺诈尝试。上面的 vanilla 用户和密码是故意设置的不安全演示值；请先替换所有 SIP "
"密码并实施认证和限流控制。将 ESL 端口 **8021** 限制为 localhost 或可信管理网络；Linphone 不需要它。使用 "
"`docker stop freeswitch && docker rm freeswitch` 停止并删除测试容器。"

